5.191.m:
They shall not even be seen by any other man on earth;
on mountain peaks, in inaccessible places that mortals cannot reach,
their dwelling shall ever be, deprived of all enjoyments!"

As many threads belonging to the lamp as are burned,
and for as many muhūrtas as the ghee-lamp endures,
for that many thousands of births shall she share in good fortune:

5.196.m:
Sūta said:
Then all those Nāgaras attained supreme satisfaction;
honoring Bhartṛyajña with various kinds of praises, // 76
